        "created_at": "2024-12-17T15:31:32.130Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What a year folks</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-86\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-86\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-86\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #86</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The last live show of the year! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:26:04 Here at the end of the year, we cover so many different topics! Certainly a wide variety of things, and not a singular focus... Anyway, here's what we're talking about at the start of next...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, January 7th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#305</span> - Creative Process: Tempest Foes</li>\n<li>Tuesday, January 14th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#306</span> - Writers’ Room: Bloodless Wraith and Haunted Fanatic</li>\n<li>Tuesday, January 21st: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#87</span></li>\n<li>Tuesday, January 28th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#307</span> - Creative Process: Distant Future Limited Series</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected Recording schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, January 3rd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#305</span> - Creative Process: Tempest Foes</li>\n<li>Friday, January 10th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#306</span> - Writers’ Room: Bloodless Wraith and Haunted Fanatic</li>\n<li>Friday, January 17th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#87</span></li>\n<li>Friday, January 24th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#307</span> - Creative Process: Distant Future Limited Series</li>\n</ul>",
