        "raw": "What a year folks\n\nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-86\n\nUpcoming schedule:\n* Tuesday, January 7th: Episode #305 - Creative Process: Tempest Foes\n* Tuesday, January 14th: Episode #306 - Writers’ Room: Bloodless Wraith and Haunted Fanatic\n* Tuesday, January 21st: Editor’s Note #87\n* Tuesday, January 28th: Episode #307 - Creative Process: Distant Future Limited Series\n\nExpected Recording schedule:\n* Friday, January 3rd: Episode #305 - Creative Process: Tempest Foes\n* Friday, January 10th: Episode #306 - Writers’ Room: Bloodless Wraith and Haunted Fanatic\n* Friday, January 17th: Editor’s Note #87\n* Friday, January 24th: Episode #307 - Creative Process: Distant Future Limited Series",
