      {
        "id": 261811,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-12-17T22:17:57.979Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am also in so much pain! I went to physical therapy today, and on the way out, I twisted my knee! And had to go do a bunch of other stuff!</p>\n<p>It surprises me that the phrase “hot sauce on cereal” dealt more damage to me than “peanut butter on a burger”.</p>\n<p>Arm Fire! You’ll get caught up in the!</p>\n<p>I love that the body count question gave them great pause. XD</p>\n<p>And then the exhaustion in Christopher’s voice as he says KNYFE hasn’t hooked up with Deathfiend lmao</p>\n<p>I think I would legit buy a “Who Is Deathfiend?” shirt with just the mask on it.</p>\n<p>Deathfiend Setback is easily the best thing to come out of this month. XD</p>\n<p>“That’s why they call him Father Christmas” is such a good line lol</p>\n<p>and that’s the last one I get to hear live, unless I am somehow lucky enough to get a job that doesn’t work on fridays</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-12-17T22:17:57.979Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
