        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I am also in so much pain! I went to physical therapy today, and on the way out, I twisted my knee! And had to go do a bunch of other stuff!\n\nIt surprises me that the phrase \"hot sauce on cereal\" dealt more damage to me than \"peanut butter on a burger\".\n\nArm Fire! You'll get caught up in the!\n\nI love that the body count question gave them great pause. XD\n\nAnd then the exhaustion in Christopher's voice as he says KNYFE hasn't hooked up with Deathfiend lmao\n\nI think I would legit buy a \"Who Is Deathfiend?\" shirt with just the mask on it.\n\nDeathfiend Setback is easily the best thing to come out of this month. XD\n\n\"That's why they call him Father Christmas\" is such a good line lol\n\nand that's the last one I get to hear live, unless I am somehow lucky enough to get a job that doesn't work on fridays",
