        "created_at": "2024-12-19T02:26:31.227Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, they answered my Deathfiend letter! (Under the name SaneCharlie. I have many names)<br>\nSo I asked about whether Deathfiend 5/8 was someone we already know - basically, if it’s guessable. I figured a ‘No’ would stop me aimlessly speculating, and a ‘Yes’ would probably set me off with a red string board trying to figure out who it could be. But to say that even answering would be a spoiler…?<br>\nHonestly I have no clue what that means! Fascinating!</p>\n<p>And Hippo! Very satisfied with the answer here. It actually highlights something that I really appreciate about Sentinel Comics, the fact that (like real-world comics) the characters aren’t really consistent over time. They shift and change and sometimes ideas don’t pan out and get reverted. It makes the world feel all lived-in!</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-12-19T02:26:31.227Z",
